      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دامر اللَّيْلَ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>He passed the night sleepless:</i>
(A:) or <i>he endured,</i> or <i>braved, the difficulty,</i> or
<i>trouble, of the night, and passed it sleepless.</i> (K.)

